{"about_the_game":"<strong>Project Abyss is a pixel-loving 2D survival RPG that takes place in the deepest place on Earth. Using a mixture of realism and fun, you control a diver and mini-submarine as you explore a living world of beautiful and deadly sea life, wreckages and enemy subs. Loot money for upgrades, complete tasks, unlock other submarines, and uncover more of the mystery deep below.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/extras/1a3029464da5cae1270ad0a832c99c5d.avif?t=1521882191\" width=589 height=82 /></span></h2><br><br>Utilise your equipment in a stylish blend of combat and beautiful aquatic moments, with a great original soundtrack and ambient sounds; we have created a living, breathing underwater world in pixel art graphics, with it's own day/night cycle. Much of the world is destructible, from blowing up wreckage doors with C4, to drilling and torpedoing your way through rock for fuel cells and chests.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/extras/82d1ea25bcbedba2f82b1ed6872cfcf2.avif?t=1521882191\" width=590 height=98 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Survive an often brutal world of bosses, turrets, and poisonous plants, filled with lots of sea life to find- including Sharks, Orcas, Whales, Jellyfish, and lots of fish!<br></li><li>  Control your submarine with the turbines; as well as claws, weaponry, and drills! #Updated to include simpler submarine controls as an option.<br></li><li>  The ability to explore outside your submarine, calling drones, repairing your sub and swimming through abandoned wreckages from pirate ships to a massive world war submarine.<br></li><li>  Lots of equipment and upgrades to purchase along 3 tech-trees... Survival, Attack and Defence.<br></li><li>  Pick up notes to build the story of one diver's destiny that will take you across huge areas; defeating bosses and unlocking the secret of the abyss.</li></ul><br><br><strong>There is a lot to see and do, with many hours of open gameplay!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/extras/4cfeb6ddbb74d3e5b589c0ae34ec8e4d.avif?t=1521882191\" width=590 height=90 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bba6e73af319d84676cef45d72f3444d58e7433d.jpg","localized_name":"Marine Be-friender","name":"Marine Be-friender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/bba6e73af319d84676cef45d72f3444d58e7433d.jpg"},{"icon":"0cbe379986b0a351a606695ec2e58dff30f29944.jpg","localized_name":"Unafraid","name":"Unafraid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/0cbe379986b0a351a606695ec2e58dff30f29944.jpg"},{"icon":"c563580cf33666b7aabca769d008f8ab6eb5c954.jpg","localized_name":"Into the Trench","name":"Into the Trench","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/c563580cf33666b7aabca769d008f8ab6eb5c954.jpg"},{"icon":"eef7b1e6fdab6eca25a363ce3bb70e0ada40b4c0.jpg","localized_name":"On the path","name":"On the path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/eef7b1e6fdab6eca25a363ce3bb70e0ada40b4c0.jpg"},{"icon":"3b811abfddb94ec3b8c536363632a67d6fd29794.jpg","localized_name":"Moving Eastward","name":"Moving Eastward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/3b811abfddb94ec3b8c536363632a67d6fd29794.jpg"},{"icon":"a47cd310f707a71933d39d716e1c39455cf8cd90.jpg","localized_name":"Conqueror","name":"Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/a47cd310f707a71933d39d716e1c39455cf8cd90.jpg"},{"icon":"39039c009dd22655288446973860735ba8867d45.jpg","localized_name":"Lets do this","name":"Lets do this","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/39039c009dd22655288446973860735ba8867d45.jpg"},{"icon":"6ac91ba5bfe9d99cf201c00c19cb0c1878ec6d1d.jpg","localized_name":"Into the deep","name":"Into the deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/6ac91ba5bfe9d99cf201c00c19cb0c1878ec6d1d.jpg"},{"icon":"1d03d63b7f1e92ced6668bbdcd4f82cfd531a9c3.jpg","localized_name":"Saviour of the trench","name":"Saviour of the trench","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/1d03d63b7f1e92ced6668bbdcd4f82cfd531a9c3.jpg"},{"icon":"0be89dd047c4a06655a24ea444b5f33aa92e38b8.jpg","localized_name":"Bug spray","name":"Bug spray","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/552410/0be89dd047c4a06655a24ea444b5f33aa92e38b8.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/552410?t=1521882191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1521882191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1521882191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1521882191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Project Abyss is a pixel-loving 2D survival RPG that takes place in the deepest place on Earth. Using a mixture of realism and fun, you control a diver and mini-submarine as you explore a living world of beautiful and deadly sea life, wreckages and enemy subs. Loot money for upgrades, complete tasks, unlock other submarines, and uncover more of the mystery deep below.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/extras/1a3029464da5cae1270ad0a832c99c5d.avif?t=1521882191\" width=589 height=82 /></span></h2><br><br>Utilise your equipment in a stylish blend of combat and beautiful aquatic moments, with a great original soundtrack and ambient sounds; we have created a living, breathing underwater world in pixel art graphics, with it's own day/night cycle. Much of the world is destructible, from blowing up wreckage doors with C4, to drilling and torpedoing your way through rock for fuel cells and chests.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552410/extras/82d1ea25bcbedba2f82b1ed6872cfcf2.avif?t=1521882191\" width=590 height=98 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Survive an often brutal world of bosses, turrets, and poisonous plants, filled with lots of sea life to find- including Sharks, Orcas, Whales, Jellyfish, and lots of fish!<br></li><li>  Control your submarine with the turbines; as well as claws, weaponry, and drills! #Updated to include simpler submarine controls as an option.<br></li><li>  The ability to explore outside your submarine, calling drones, repairing your sub and swimming through abandoned wreckages from pirate ships to a massive world war submarine.<br></li><li>  Lots of equipment and upgrades to purchase along 3 tech-trees... Survival, Attack and Defence.<br></li><li>  Pick up notes to build the story of one diver's destiny that will take you across huge areas; defeating bosses and unlocking the secret of the abyss.</li></ul><br><br><strong>There is a lot to see and do, with many hours of open gameplay!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta